iia-tr:TR-CYBER-RM-B a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader iia-tr:TR-CYBER-RM ;
    skos:definition "Cyber risk is managed across the organization, covering technology, enterprise risk, people, legal, compliance, operations, suppliers and finance."@en,
