iia-tr:TR-THIRD-PARTY-RM-C a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader iia-tr:TR-THIRD-PARTY-RM ;
    skos:definition "Risk responses match the ranking and are approved, implemented, monitored and adjusted."@en,
        "Les réponses aux risques correspondent au classement et sont approuvées, mises en œuvre, suivies et ajustées."@fr ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/crgo/vocab/iia-tr> ;
    skos:notation "TR-THIRD-PARTY-RM-C" ;
    skos:note "Label written by CRGO: the source gives no heading for this item."@en ;
