iia-tr:TR-THIRD-PARTY-RM-D a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader iia-tr:TR-THIRD-PARTY-RM ;
    skos:definition "Third-party issues are managed and escalated, and unresolved concerns lead management to reconsider, remediate or end the relationship."@en,
        "Les problèmes liés aux tiers sont gérés et remontés ; les préoccupations non résolues amènent la direction à reconsidérer, corriger ou rompre la relation."@fr ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/crgo/vocab/iia-tr> ;
    skos:notation "TR-THIRD-PARTY-RM-D" ;
    skos:note "Label written by CRGO: the source gives no heading for this item."@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "Third-party issue escalation"@en,
        "Remontée des problèmes liés aux tiers"@fr ;
