iia-tr:TR-THIRD-PARTY-GOV a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader iia-tr:TR-THIRD-PARTY ;
    skos:definition "Auditors examine board oversight, sourcing decisions, policies, roles and stakeholder reporting for third-party relationships."@en,
